source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A later backslash in the same token keeps the pair literal and the run of four never breaks, so Jira shows all six backslashes and jiro keeps them.
-- input.jira --
a\\b\\\\c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\b\\\\c</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\b\\\\\\\\c
-- warnings.json --
[]
